ết nối DB; không gửi request vào production." style="text;html=0;fontSize=20;align=left;verticalAlign=top;"><mxGeometry x="40" y="907" width="1300" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>